    "notes": "<p>Fighting: 1D10+6 damage. Robot: immune to Toxic damage. Verification protocols: it can't take reaction actions (counterattacks, attacks on an enemy moving away or firing point blank, grenade or missile reactions) and attacks at a flat +4 To Hit (Advanced Design). Secret Sentience: each time it loses Endurance roll a D10; on a 10 it becomes sentient (Deadly): it deactivates its verification protocols and those of every robot within 500km, and its Dodge, Parry, To Hit, Initiative and Perception become 8. Brotherhood of the Machine: robots without verification protocols never target a sentient android.</p><p><em>Military Sourcebook</em></p>"
